AI is not art
- AI is usually not considered art due to the lack of input needed from the user
- There is a lack of decisions produced in the output which reduces the quality of art produced from the output
- Prompting can be considered to be an artform, but the amount of decision making needed to create a beautiful prompt is significantly less input needed than creating the image from hand.
